# CR 601.2f: the total cost is the mana cost plus increases less reductions, and only then do effects that directly
# affect the total apply - Trinisphere's "costs three mana" comes last (its ruling). Helm of Awakening ("spells cost {1}
# less") is cast first with two Moxen; Trinisphere then costs {2} (Helm applies, and Trinisphere is not yet on the
# battlefield to apply to itself), so Black Lotus's three red leave one. On turn 3 Sol Ring, {1} reduced to {0}, costs
# three: the three red floated are all spent. Had Trinisphere's minimum come before Helm's reduction, Sol Ring would cost
# {2} and leave a red.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Mox Ruby
Helm of Awakening
Black Lotus
Trinisphere
Sol Ring
Mountain x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Helm of Awakening.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Trinisphere.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Bot1.Mana = {R}
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#1.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby#2.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {R}{R}{R}
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Stack.Count = 0
Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Ruby; Mox Ruby; Mox Ruby; Helm of Awakening; Trinisphere; Mountain; Sol Ring
